thub.com/users/mlaraba","html_url":"https://github.com/mlaraba","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mlaraba/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-12T09:44:07Z","updated_at":"2025-11-12T09:46:49Z","body":"@blueskythlikesclouds Finally, i was able to find out what was in the scene causing it...and come up with a MRP\n\nOne object that I suspected something wrong with it long ago, cause it was causing a flickering glow (when glow is used) so i though i must have done something wrong with it's normals or something in Blender and i will go back and see what's wrong with this object one day.\nbut i still believe Godot shouldn't go crazy over one object like this (even if it there is an issue with the object) and not giving any feedback. so it's up to you if you want to investigate this issue i'm attaching more details and the scene\n\nSo again it only happens when:\nUnchecking half size in SSR Env Settings.\nUsing SSR with SDFGI.\nand when that object is using an external material (created in Godot) in the GLTF import setting for some reasons\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/791d424f-c44a-477d-8dda-639da9b266b4)\n\n[SRR-Issue_MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23496352/SRR-Issue_MRP.zip)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3521019220